{% comment %}
  Get Measurement Label Helper Snippet

  This snippet provides access to size guide measurement labels using Shopify's metafield translation system.
  It replaces the old locale-based translation approach with metafield-based translations.

  SCOPE: Only handles actual measurement labels (body and product measurements)
  UI texts (table headers, modal texts, etc.) remain in local translation files

  Accepts:
  - type: {String} 'body' or 'product' - determines which metafield to use
  - key: {String} the measurement key (e.g., 'chest', 'waist_girth')

  Usage:
  {% render 'get-measurement-label', type: 'body', key: 'chest' %}
  {% render 'get-measurement-label', type: 'product', key: 'waist_girth' %}

  Returns the translated label for the measurement based on current locale.
  Falls back to old translation system if metafields are not configured.
{% endcomment %}

{% comment %} Get the appropriate metafield based on type {% endcomment %}
{% if type == 'body' %}
  {% assign measurements = shop.metafields.size_guide.body_measurements.value %}
{% elsif type == 'product' %}
  {% assign measurements = shop.metafields.size_guide.product_measurements.value %}
{% endif %}

{% comment %} Try to get label from metafield first {% endcomment %}
{% assign label = measurements[key] %}

{% comment %} Fallback to old translation system if metafield not available {% endcomment %}
{% unless label %}
  {% if type == 'body' %}
    {% assign fallback_key = 'size_guide.measurements.' | append: key %}
  {% elsif type == 'product' %}
    {% assign fallback_key = 'size_guide.product_measurements.' | append: key %}
  {% endif %}
  {% assign label = fallback_key | t %}
{% endunless %}

{% comment %} Output the label {% endcomment %}
{{ label }}
